# Giles scan exclusions for cuttlefish.
# Vendored JS dependencies and build/test output: not authored here, gitignored,
# and not governed content. Giles now prunes these by default (see
# giles/src/giles/scan.py::DEFAULT_SKIP_DIR_NAMES); this file states the intent
# repo-locally and covers the pnpm/playwright paths specific to this workspace.
node_modules
*/node_modules
packages/*/node_modules
.pnpm-store
test-results
playwright-report
